## Categories

- **Browser VM / Emulator:** Runs virtualization or emulation through the browser.
- **Cloud VM:** A VM hosted remotely by a cloud provider.
- **Cloud PC:** A remotely hosted desktop operating system.
- **Cloud environment:** A browser development/container environment rather than a conventional desktop VM.
- **OS simulation:** A web recreation of an operating system interface; not necessarily a real VM.
- **Local virtualization:** Software/platforms normally installed on your own computer or server.
- **Remote desktop:** Provides access to an existing remote machine rather than necessarily creating a VM itself.

